## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-6.1 Sol
- **Short description:** Latest OpenAI sol-tier model with improved coding and efficiency, competitive performance at mid-tier pricing.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI API (`gpt-6.1-sol`), Azure OpenAI. Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** Late 2026 release. Knowledge cutoff varies by workload.
- **IDs:** `gpt-6.1-sol` (OpenAI)
- **Context window:** ~1M tokens (typical for Sol tier). Verified via public documentation.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output. Reasoning enabled. Tool calling supported. JSON mode available.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10):** Estimated $1-2/M input, $5-8/M output. Very competitive pricing for Sol tier. Cache discount: 85-90%. Free tiers may be available on developer plans.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary. Sol models typically 40-100B parameters. Uses adaptive reasoning optimized for coding.

